# Commit messages (Source Control “Generate commit message”)

Keep generated Git commit messages short:
- One subject line, ideally under 72 characters
- Focus on why, not a file-by-file restatement of the diff
- No multi-paragraph essays; add at most 1–2 short body lines only when needed
- Prefer the style: “Rename GrovSeeds to GrovPods in admin UI and help guide.”
